From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mythiccal <cwood2014.cw@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 16:21:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Parallel world ticking

Port SparklyPaper parallel world ticking from DivineMC. Each world ticks on its own thread, bounded by a semaphore, and per-world MSPT samples feed the Bukkit tick-time API.

